{"id":3346,"date":"2026-06-22T12:36:59","date_gmt":"2026-06-22T12:36:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3346"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:48:23","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:48:23","slug":"lotus-garden-vertical-stone-mural","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/lotus-garden-vertical-stone-mural\/","title":{"rendered":"Lotus Garden Vertical Stone Mural"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"1142\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"702\">Lotus Garden Vertical Stone Mural Panel<\/strong>, a premium handcrafted architectural wall d\u00e9cor solution inspired by the timeless beauty of nature and traditional artistic stone craftsmanship. Designed with intricate carving precision, this elegant mural showcases a beautifully arranged vertical composition of lotus flowers, delicate floral patterns, natural stems, layered botanical detailing, and organic sculptural textures that create a visually striking decorative statement wall.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1566\">Crafted using premium quality natural stone materials, this luxury mural combines sophisticated craftsmanship with natural design aesthetics to bring warmth, elegance, and artistic richness into premium architectural spaces. The vertical floral arrangement creates a seamless decorative composition that adds depth, texture, and refined character while transforming ordinary walls into premium handcrafted design features.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"2083\">Engineered for durability and long-lasting visual appeal, this decorative stone mural offers exceptional structural strength, premium surface finishing, and minimal maintenance requirements for everyday interior and architectural applications. Ideal for luxury villas, premium residences, landscape walls, hotel interiors, spa spaces, decorative courtyards, feature walls, reception areas, and bespok